      "Verified Book Descriptions or Synopses": "Normal Calm: Amina, an Arab American university student, is betrayed and assaulted by a man she considered a brother, leaving her 'unmarriageable' in her community's eyes; after her mother's breakdown she falls in love with Sherif and must face whether he can accept her past (Goodreads description). Behind Picket Fences: four families on the same street each hide private struggles such as infertility, financial strain, mental instability and serious illness; described as an honest portrayal of love and family (Goodreads description).",
