      "Personalized Subject Line": "A home online for Normal Calm and Behind Picket Fences",
      "Personalized Email Body": "Hi Hend,\n\nMy name is Femi Emmanuel. I'm a designer and book services specialist, helping authors professionally present, publish, and promote their books.\n\nI came across Normal Calm and Behind Picket Fences while researching your work. I was particularly interested in Amina's story in Normal Calm, a young Arab American woman fighting to be seen as more than what was done to her, and in the four families of Behind Picket Fences, each hiding its own struggle behind the same quiet street.\n\nThose details gave me an idea for how a book-focused website could help present your novels to more of the readers who may enjoy them. I noticed that hendhegazi.com now forwards to your Write Minded coaching site, where the novels are not listed, so readers looking for your fiction have no single home for it. A simple books section, with a page for each novel and its themes, could sit alongside your coaching work.\n\nI'd be happy to put together a complimentary concept sample so you can see the direction I have in mind.\n\nWould you be open to taking a look?\n\nWarm regards,\nFemi Emmanuel",
